entries[126032] = { ["name"] = "Warmongering Combatant's Dragonhide Gloves", ["text"] = "Warlords Season 3\nBinds when picked up\nHands Leather\n4 Armor\n+3 [Agility or Intellect]\n+5 Stamina\n+ 3 Critical Strike\n+ 3 Mastery\nDurability 50 / 50\nClasses: Druid\nRequires any Alliance race\nGladiator's Sanctuary (0/5)\nGladiator's Dragonhide Robes\nGladiator's Dragonhide Helm\nGladiator's Dragonhide Gloves\nGladiator's Dragonhide Spaulders\nGladiator's Dragonhide Legguards\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Balance: Increases the damage bonus from Lunar and Solar Empowerments by 4%.\n(2) Set Feral: Interrupting a spell with Skull Bash resets the cooldown of Tiger's Fury.\n(2) Set Guardian: If you hit a player with Mangle while they are casting or channeling a spell, their damage and healing will be reduced by 35% for 3 sec.\n(2) Set Restoration: Your Ironbark now also grants the target Nature's Grasp, which roots the first 2 attackers for 6 sec.\n(4) Set Balance: When Starsurge hits a player, the cast time of Lunar Strike is reduced by 30%, and the damage of Solar Wrath is increased by 30% for 6 sec.\n(4) Set Feral: Shred critical strikes causes the target to take 10% increased damage from your bleed effects for 6 sec.\n(4) Set Guardian: While Survival Instincts is active, 35% of the direct damage you deal will heal the 2 nearest allies.\n(4) Set Restoration: Increases the periodic healing of Lifebloom by 15%.\nSell Price:" }
