entries[126386] = { ["name"] = "Warmongering Gladiator's Ironskin Gloves", ["text"] = "Warlords Season 3\nBinds when picked up\nHands Leather\n4 Armor\n+4 [Agility or Intellect]\n+5 Stamina\n+ 4 Critical Strike\n+ 4 Haste\nDurability 55 / 55\nClasses: Monk\nRequires any Horde race\nGladiator's Ironskin (0/5)\nGladiator's Ironskin Tunic\nGladiator's Ironskin Helm\nGladiator's Ironskin Gloves\nGladiator's Ironskin Spaulders\nGladiator's Ironskin Legguards\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Brewmaster: When you use [ Chi Torpedo / Roll], the Energy cost of your Tiger Palm is reduced by 30 for 4 sec.\n(2) Set Windwalker: Touch of Karma now has a threshold of 100% of your maximum health.\n(2) Set Mistweaver: Enveloping Mist reduces the target's chance to be hit with a critical strike by 20% for 6 sec.\n(4) Set Brewmaster: Increases the damage done by your Breath of Fire by 30%.\n(4) Set Windwalker: Storm, Earth, and Fire grants you 8% damage reduction for 20 sec. (1s cooldown)\n(4) Set Mistweaver: Reduces the cooldown of Life Cocoon by 45 sec.\nSell Price:" }
